# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Trading System v2 — .gitignore
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Credentials — NEVER commit
.env
env
# Rotated-credential spreadsheet — plaintext seeds, must NEVER be committable
# (the C-1 secret scanner does not scan .xlsx; gitignore + deletion are the controls)
credentials.xlsx

# SQLite databases
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
data_store/

# Logs
logs/
*.log

# Generated reports
reports/daily/
reports/output/*.xlsx
# A base64-of-XLSX .txt walked straight past the *.xlsx rule above and committed a
# 1.44 MB report — with real trade data in it — into the repo. Ignore the ENCODED forms
# too, not just the extension: the rule protects the DATA, not the suffix.
reports/output/*_b64.txt
reports/output/*.b64
reports/output/*.xlsx.txt
reports/system_manager/
reports/cron_officer/

# Generated data (regenerated on the VM daily by refresh_instruments.py;
# must NOT be git-tracked or the deploy hook's `git checkout -f` silently
# reverts the VM's fresh copy to the committed version — instruments staleness
# incident 21-Jun-2026).
config/instruments.csv

# System manuals (Word docs synced to VM out-of-band, not via git)
docs/system_manuals/*.docx

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
*.egg

# Virtual environments
venv/
.venv/
env/
.env/

# pytest cache
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.bak

# Claude Code internals
memory/
# RETIRED 04-Aug-2026 (D5 / R13) — but the ignore STAYS, deliberately.
# The file is still on disk and is PC-local; dropping this line would surface it
# as untracked in every `git status` and risk committing it by accident.
# ⛔ Retiring an artifact is NOT the same act as making it committable.
# Its one piece of unique content (F1–F9) was migrated verbatim first, to
# ops_dashboard/docs/F_BACKLOG.md — that migration is what made the retirement safe.
mempalace.yaml
CLAUDE_md_and_explanations.txt
.claude/settings.local.json

sats/

# GUI redesign design-spec source .txt (consumed by the completed G5 redesign;
# Audit-B Phase-1 flagged gui/ as untracked debt). Kept local, not deployed.
gui/
